From c99b28e5a6e951a42ec2ebacf07af6bdff07a675 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 05:48:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dwrc-net/dwrc: klien MMO protokol v2 (WebSocket persisten,
 UDP ber-MAC, pemain lain di minimap)

- dwrc-net: client.rs (tungstenite, koneksi dipertahankan, register/login), proto.rs
  (paket 44B + HMAC, parse relay, SeqGen), state.rs (NetShared)
- Hapus authenticate_ws lama (JSON dirakit dengan format!, handshake statis) dan paket UDP v1
- emu.rs: resolve alamat UDP sekali, kirim v2, kuras relay masuk
- app.rs: layar Register, koneksi WS dipertahankan, deteksi sesi berakhir, default password 'dev_hash' dihapus,
  pemain lain digambar di minimap
- Tes: 7 unit (termasuk vektor lintas-bahasa dengan server Node) + 1 end-to-end klien Rust vs server Node
